,
  "purpose": "These three sequences isolate the three put conflict modes and the three channel definitions. Repeated puts to the same key make INSERT OR IGNORE, INSERT OR REPLACE, and ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE differ in both committed value and channel count. Adding a put on the other connection separates main-only counters from the combined main+other counter. The trigger, if present, adds a constant per successful insert, so it shifts all channel values but does not change the pattern of differences."
}
